  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Non earmarked voluntary contribution for Development Assistance Committee (DAC) - budget cycle 2025-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Non earmarked voluntary contribution for the Development Assistance Committee (DAC) in the 2025-2026 budget cycle aims to provide institutional support to an international think and do tank. This organization focuses on researching EU-AU relations and EU development policy, as well as facilitating dialogue between African and European partners. The project does not specify a particular country or sector within the EU or Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
